 来源：第77页。固定k≥2，找出数组中k个不同下标的元素，使总和等于target，输出不重复的值组合。先排序；固定第一个数字x后，剩余问题就是在更后面下标中找(k−1)个数，目标改成target−x；k=2时用双指针收尾。 

 |nums=[−1,0,1,2,−1,−4]，k=3，target=0|过程|
|---|---|
|排序|[−4,−1,−1,0,1,2]|
|固定−4|后缀找和4，无解|
|固定第一个−1|后缀找和1，找到[−1,2]和[0,1]|
|固定第二个−1|同层重复，跳过|
|最终|[−1,−1,2]、[−1,0,1]|

 java
import java.util.ArrayList;
import java.util.Arrays;
import java.util.List;
class Solution {
    public ListListInteger kSum(int[] nums, int k, long target) {
        if (k  2) throw new IllegalArgumentException("k must be at least 2");
        int[] a = nums.clone();
        Arrays.sort(a);
        return solve(a, 0, k, target);
    }
    private ListListInteger solve(int[] a, int start, int k, long target) {
        ListListInteger answer = new ArrayList();
        if (a.length - start  k) return answer;
        if (k == 2) {
            int left = start, right = a.length - 1;
            while (left  right) {
                long sum = (long) a[left] + a[right];
                if (sum  target) left++;
                else if (sum  target) right--;
                else {
                    answer.add(Arrays.asList(a[left], a[right]));
                    int low = a[left], high = a[right];
                    while (left  right && a[left] == low) left++;
                    while (left  right && a[right] == high) right--;
                }
            }
            return answer;
        }
        for (int i = start; i = a.length - k; i++) {
            if (i  start && a[i] == a[i - 1]) continue;
            for (ListInteger tail : solve(a, i + 1, k - 1, target - a[i])) {
                ListInteger combination = new ArrayList();
                combination.add(a[i]);
                combination.addAll(tail);
                answer.add(combination);
            }
        }
        return answer;
    }
}


 (long)a[left]在加法之前提升类型，避免两个int先溢出；target也用long，让多项累加更安全。Arrays.asList生成定长列表，能读取但不能add/remove；这里只把二元结果保存，向上合并时用新的ArrayList和addAll，因此不会触发UnsupportedOperationException。i+1保证下标不重复；相等值同层跳过，双指针命中后跳过左右重复值，两处一起保证结果去重。固定k时主搜索O(n^(k−1))，再加排序O(nlogn)与输出复制；递归深O(k)，返回列表的存储随输出大小增长。 

